I left out the two operations requests. This node's declared capability is `inference-llm` only, and the file log and metadata fetch would each need a new import, which would widen what the node can reach. The metadata call would also send feed text to an external host. Those belong in a node or host component that declares those capabilities. The classifier below is unchanged by their absence.

